  We use this project's formalization of the Wiener–Ikehara theorem
  (`WienerIkeharaTheorem''`) in `PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/Wiener.lean` to
  discharge the analytic number theory step that bounds the partial
  sums of `log p` over primes `p ≡ 1 (mod 3)`.  The wiring is in
  `ErdosUnitDistance/TierD/PrimesCongOneMod3_proved.lean`.

  We thank Alex Kontorovich and the PrimeNumberTheoremAnd contributors
  for making this foundational analytic number theory infrastructure
  available to the Lean community.

